Someone descended from Shechem who was a man of the tribe of Manasseh living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Num.26.31; 
son of: Gilead (H1568H); 
brother of: Abiezer (H0044I), Helek (H2507), Asriel (H0844), Shemida (H8061) and Hepher (H2660A)
Group of she.khem (שֶׁ֫כֶם "Shechem" H7928) 
§ Shechemites = "shoulder"
descendants of Shechem

A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.3.21; 
son of: Hananiah (H2608L); 
brother of: Pelatiah (H6410), Jeshaiah (H3470B), Rephaiah (H7509), Arnan (H0770) and Obadiah (H5662H); 
father of: Shemaiah (H8098B)
§ Shecaniah or Shechaniah = "dweller with Jehovah"
1) a descendant of Zerubbabel whose descendants returned from exile with Ezra
2) son of Jehiel of the sons of…

